==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[consultation]] ''(Only noun form in UK)''

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|consulter}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|consultare||to deliberate, consult}}, frequentative of {{term|consulere||to consult, deliberate, consider, reflect upon, ask advice}}, from {{term|com-||together}} + {{term|-sulere}}, of uncertain origin.

